BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Music in the Gallery-Linda Warnaar
DTSTART:20261120T130000
DTEND:20261120T140000
DTSTAMP:20261120T190958Z
UID:73b292fa6a799adc788e692a2f625c@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the splendid setting of the 19th-century Art Galler
 y for our Music Series with Linda Warnaar. Linda Warnaar has been writing 
 and playing original songs throughout her lifetime. She draws from many ge
 nres including blues\, Latin\, jazz\, and folk. Linda has recorded 6 album
 s of her original music\, and is a member of several diverse ensembles\, i
 ncluding Chickweed\, Tritium Well\, Elmundo\, and Whiskers of Odd. Linda t
 eaches Cuban and Haitian Drumming\, plays drum set\, guitar\, and trumpet.
  Growing up in a musical family\, music has always been a huge part of her
  life and community. This event is free\, ADA accessible\, and open to the
  public. Music in the Art Gallery Upcoming Artists: December 18 - Kingdom 
 Mountain Dulcimers with Reeve Lindbergh\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:St. Johnsbury Athenaeum\, 1171 Main St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/music-in-t
 he-gallery-linda-warnaar-12-11-2026-12-04-59
END:VEVENT
