DESCRIPTION:Equinox Documentary Film Festival\, now in its 7th year\, 3rd 
 at the Savoy Theater in Montpelier\, bringing together the best of documen
 tary shorts to a single-day\, 180 min screening in one of Vermont's most b
 eautiful theaters. With films from up-and-coming filmmakers through to sea
 soned professionals\, the Equinox Documentary Film Festival is an event wh
 ich showcases the best of locally driven social and environmental initiati
