BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Folded Paper Ornaments with Beads Workshop at Fiddleheads Gallery
DTSTART:20261121T110000
DTEND:20261121T133000
DTSTAMP:20261120T190958Z
UID:908715f48daa794a318a43df36c58b@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Fold\, shape\, and create a beautiful German Bell ornament fro
 m a simple square of paper! With just 10 folds\, you’ll transform decora
 tive paper into a distinctive bell\, then personalize it with beads and a 
 coordinating tie-loop. There’s plenty of time to experiment with differe
 nt papers\, colors\, and embellishments as you create at least two unique 
 bells to take home. Come fold\, play\, and create! Age range: 15+\n\nSourc
 es: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Fiddleheads Gallery\, Deerfield Valley Art Association\, 105 Main
  Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/folded-pap
 er-ornaments-with-beads-workshop-at-fiddleheads-gallery-17-11-2026-11-32-4
 6
END:VEVENT
