BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dec. 8 | Brave Little State at 14th Star Brewery
DTSTART:20261208T173000
DTEND:20261208T193000
DTSTAMP:20261120T190958Z
UID:4c2a00fcf37891014a73a9774ef8f3@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join the team from Brave Little State on December 8 in St. Alb
 ans to mingle with fellow listeners and choose a topic for a future episod
 e. Take part in a spirited live voting round where you and other attendees
  can submit your questions about Vermont for the team to consider. The top
  three question askers will be invited to “stump” for their question a
 s the audience votes on their favorite. We’ll have some Brave Little Sta
 te merch to show off your fan status or for holiday gifting. Bring your bu
 rning questions about Vermont\, the show or how our stories get made. Plus
 \, we’ll share a special\, sneak preview for a series we’re putting to
 gether about Vermont’s northern border. Tickets are $10 and support Brav
 e Little State and Vermont Public. The first 100 attendees will receive a 
 vintage Lawson’s Brave Little State Pale Ale pint glass. Click here to r
 eserve your ticket . If space allows\, tickets will be available at the do
 or. This event is made possible with support from Union Bank of Vermont an
 d New Hampshire \, Northwestern Medical Center and Haddad Subaru of St. Al
 bans . Schedule 5:30 p.m. - Event begins 5:45 p.m. - Welcome | Question su
 bmissions begin 6:30 p.m. - Question submission ends | Voting round begins
  7:00 p.m. - Voting round ends | Winners are announced 7:30 p.m. - Event e
 nds Accommodations Vermont Public is committed to providing access and acc
 ommodation for individuals with disabilities at our events. To request acc
 ommodations\, please email events@vermontpublic.org or call us at 802-655-
 9451 at least seven days in advance of the event. Cancellation Policy Plea
 se let us know by emailing events@vermontpublic.org if you are not able to
  join us so that we may release your tickets to someone else. If tickets a
 re able to be resold\, we are happy to offer a refund\, minus the processi
 ng fees. Directions and Parking 14th Star Brewing Co. is located at 133 N 
 Main St #7\, St Albans City\, VT 05478 . There is plenty of free parking i
 n the St. Albans Shopping Center parking lot. Other questions? Email us at
  events@vermontpublic.org .\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:14th Star Brewery\, 133 N Main St Ste 7
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/dec-1-brav
 e-little-state-at-14th-star-brewery-02-09-2026-10-48-40
END:VEVENT
